---
# Scoped overrides for lessons/dynamic_array/1. Inherits the project-root
# .clang-tidy and only adjusts what's noisy for this specific lesson.
#
# prefer-member-initializer is silenced here because this lesson deliberately
# uses body-assignment ctors (this->x = in_x;) for teaching purposes — the
# init-list lesson is introduced later when a member type makes it load-bearing
# (const, reference, or non-trivially-constructible).
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -cppcoreguidelines-prefer-member-initializer
---
